    * fix: remove oauth2ResourceServer from SecurityConfig — was intercepting /login/oauth2/code/keycloak callback
    
    Resource server JWT filter was catching the OAuth2 authorization code callback
    and trying to validate the 'code' as a JWT token, causing redirect to /login?error.
    
    Also removed stale resourceserver.jwt config from application.yml.
    
    * fix: override redirect_uri with public BASE_URL via custom authorizationRequestResolver
    
    Spring Security was generating redirect_uri from the incoming request
    (http://localhost:8080 behind Cloudflare Tunnel), which the browser
    cannot follow. Custom OAuth2AuthorizationRequestResolver now forces
    redirect_uri to https://windband.michalbzowski.pl/login/oauth2/code/keycloak.
    
