    * fix: bypass OidcUserService.loadUser() — manually fetch user-info to avoid discovery URL issues
    
    OidcUserService.loadUser() was hanging/timing out, likely because Spring
    Security's discovery mechanism overrode user-info-uri with the public
    keycloak.michalbzowski.pl URL from the OpenID config, which is unreachable
    from the container. Now we manually fetch user-info using the configured
    user-info-uri (localhost:8180) via RestClient.
    
    * debug: add more logging in KeycloakOAuth2UserService to trace where it hangs
    
    * fix: use @Value for user-info-uri instead of ClientRegistration API
    
