    Token was being rejected by Keycloak user-info endpoint (401) because
    the token's 'iss' claim contained keycloak.michalbzowski.pl (from
    KC_HOSTNAME) but the request was going to localhost:8180. Setting
    KC_HOSTNAME=localhost makes the issuer match the internal URL.
    
