    - DB_HOST=db (Docker service name)
    - KEYCLOAK_URL=http://keycloak:8180 (Docker service name)
    - KC_HOSTNAME=keycloak.michalbzowski.pl (public URL for Keycloak login pages)
    
    This allows Spring Security to reach Keycloak via Docker internal DNS
    while Keycloak generates correct public URLs for browser redirects.
    
